     "explanation": "The Introduction states the guidelines \"have been approved by the four organizations that make up the Cooperating Parties for the ICD-10-CM: the American Hospital Association (AHA), the American Health Information Management Association (AHIMA), CMS, and NCHS.\" The AMA is not named. WHO publishes ICD-10, the base classification, but is not a Cooperating Party. CMS and NCHS alone *provide* the guidelines, but approval comes from all four Cooperating Parties.",
