     "explanation": "Correct: Section I.B.10 lists infertility due to tubal occlusion from old tuberculosis as an example of sequela and states the condition or nature of the sequela is sequenced first and the sequela code second. Options A and B use the code for the acute phase, which is never used with a code for the late effect. Option C leaves out the nature of the sequela, which is sequenced first.",
