     "explanation": "Correct: Section I.C.1.g.1.m says U09.9 should not be assigned for manifestations of an active (current) COVID-19 infection. This case is coded U07.1 and J80 per I.C.1.g.1.c.iv. Options A and B are wrong because U09.9 is for conditions following a previous infection. Option D is wrong because I.C.1.g.1.c.iv specifically gives codes for ARDS due to COVID-19.",
