     "explanation": "Correct: B. Section I.C.2.j: C80.0 is only for advanced metastatic disease when no known primary or secondary sites are specified. It should not be used in place of codes for the primary site and all known secondary sites.\n\nB is wrong: advanced disease alone is not enough; the sites here are known. C is wrong: the guideline limits C80.0 to cases with no known sites, so it is not added on top of site codes. D is wrong: the guideline does not tie C80.0 to the inpatient setting (that note applies to C80.1).",
