     "explanation": "Correct: B. Section I.C.2.c.2: when the encounter is for management of an anemia associated with an adverse effect of chemotherapy or immunotherapy and the only treatment is for the anemia, the anemia is sequenced first, followed by the neoplasm and the adverse effect code (T45.1X5-).\n\nA is wrong: malignancy-first applies to anemia associated with the malignancy itself (c.1). B is wrong: the visit is for the anemia, not for administering chemotherapy. D is wrong: the adverse effect code is listed after the anemia and neoplasm codes.",
