     "explanation": "Correct: B. The official text of Section I.C.3 is only: Reserved for future guideline expansion.\n\nA is wrong: Section I.C.3 has no sequencing rules; the anemia sequencing rules you have learned are in the neoplasm guidelines (Section I.C.2.c). C is wrong: diabetes is in Section I.C.4.a. D is wrong: HIV is not covered in Section I.C.3.",
