     "explanation": "Correct: C. Section I.C.4.a.3: if the patient is treated with both oral hypoglycemic drugs and insulin, both code Z79.4 and code Z79.84 should be assigned.\n\nA and C are wrong: each one captures only one of the two drug types. D is wrong: Z79.85 is for injectable non-insulin antidiabetic drugs, which are not documented.",
