     "explanation": "Correct: I27 code plus associated conditions or adverse effects. Section I.C.9.a.11 says pulmonary hypertension is classified to category I27, and for secondary pulmonary hypertension (I27.1, I27.2-) code also any associated conditions or adverse effects of drugs or toxins. I15 is for secondary (systemic) hypertension, not pulmonary hypertension. R03.0 is for transient elevated readings. I16 is for hypertensive crisis.",
