     "explanation": "Correct: Section I.C.10.e states \"it would be appropriate to code separately any gastrointestinal symptoms, such as diarrhea and abdominal pain.\" Option A confuses them with respiratory symptoms, which are not coded separately once a definitive diagnosis is established. Option C contradicts the rule that U07.0 is principal. Option B invents a condition not in the guideline.",
