     "title": "Official Text: Section I.C.11",
     "content": "**Section I.C.11 — Chapter 11: Diseases of the Digestive System (K00-K95)**\n\n**Reserved for future guideline expansion**\n\n*Source: ICD-10-CM Official Guidelines for Coding and Reporting, FY 2027 (CMS & NCHS), verbatim.*",
