     "explanation": "Section I.C.19.d.5 says to assign separate codes for each burn site, that T30 is extremely vague and should rarely be used, and that 'multiple sites' codes should only be assigned when the documentation does not specify the individual sites. Here the sites are documented. T30 is not preferred for multiple burns, and pairing it with T31 does not fix the problem. T30's title includes both burns and corrosions, so 'only for corrosions' is wrong.",
